summary:
  Trending now scrolls to the searching line at the tap and never to the answer itself.

history:
  Seen on 2026-09-23: seven seconds after Trending now the popup showed the
  saved stations and nothing else, with thirty results under them. The tap
  alone brings only the one-line footer into sight, at the bottom of the
  view, and the answer then grows below it; the second reveal is what puts
  the answer's heading at the top.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
              ViewLogic.revealFooter(stationView)
          })
      }

      // One country's best stations

replace:
              void 0
          })
      }

      // One country's best stations

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_rails_bring_their_answer_into_sight.
  Line-neutral.
